  "lines": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.05,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "五人大笑声中，兜转马头。林平之纵马疾驰，却不沿原路回去，转而向北，疾驰一阵，这才尽兴，勒马缓缓而行。",
      "file": "line_000.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 12708,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 92,
      "pause_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "只见前面路旁挑出一个酒招子。",
      "file": "line_001.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 3492,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 27,
      "pause_after_ms": 300
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "role": "郑镖头",
      "voice_id": "male-qn-jingying",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.05,
      "pitch": -1,
      "text": "少镖头，咱们去喝一杯怎么样？新鲜兔肉、野鸡肉，正好炒了下酒。",
      "file": "line_002.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 6444,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 55,
      "pause_after_ms": 350
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "role": "林平之",
      "voice_id": "male-qn-qingse",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.05,
      "pitch": 1,
      "text": "你跟我出来打猎是假，喝酒才是正经事。若不请你喝上个够，明儿便懒洋洋的不肯跟我出来了。",
      "file": "line_003.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 7416,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 80,
      "pause_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "一勒马，飘身跃下马背，缓步走向酒肆。",
      "file": "line_004.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 4752,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 33,
      "pause_after_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "若在往日，店主人老蔡早已抢出来接他手中马缰：",
      "file": "line_005.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 5652,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 42,
      "pause_after_ms": 300
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "少镖头今儿打了这么多野味啊，当真箭法如神，当世少有！这么奉承一番。",
      "file": "line_006.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 7776,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 62,
      "pause_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "但此刻来到店前，酒店中却静悄悄地，只见酒炉旁有个青衣少女，头束双鬟，插着两支荆钗，正在料理酒水，脸儿向里，也不转过身来。",
      "file": "line_007.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 16452,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 112,
      "pause_after_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "role": "郑镖头",
      "voice_id": "male-qn-jingying",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "vol": 1.1,
      "speed": 1.05,
      "pitch": -1,
      "text": "老蔡呢，怎么不出来牵马？",
      "file": "line_008.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 2916,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 22,
      "pause_after_ms": 300
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "白二、陈七拉开长凳，用衣袖拂去灰尘，请林平之坐了。",
      "file": "line_009.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 6732,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 46,
      "pause_after_ms": 300
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "史郑二位镖头在下首相陪，两个趟子手另坐一席。",
      "file": "line_010.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 6516,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 42,
      "pause_after_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.0,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "内堂里咳嗽声响，走出一个白发老人来，说道：",
      "file": "line_011.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 5112,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 39,
      "pause_after_ms": 300
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "role": "萨老头",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_male_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "pitch": -3,
      "text": "客官请坐，喝酒么？说的是北方口音。",
      "file": "line_012.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 5148,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 31,
      "pause_after_ms": 300
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "role": "郑镖头",
      "voice_id": "male-qn-jingying",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "vol": 1.1,
      "speed": 1.05,
      "pitch": -1,
      "text": "不喝酒，难道还喝茶？先打三斤竹叶青上来。老蔡哪里去啦？怎么？这酒店换了老板么？",
      "file": "line_013.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 8064,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 72,
      "pause_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "role": "萨老头",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_male_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "pitch": -3,
      "text": "是，是，宛儿，打三斤竹叶青。",
      "file": "line_014.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 5364,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 24,
      "pause_after_ms": 300
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "role": "萨老头",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_male_1",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "pitch": -3,
      "text": "不瞒众位客官说，小老儿姓萨，原是本地人氏，自幼在外做生意，儿子媳妇都死了，心想树高千丈，叶落归根，这才带了这孙女儿回故乡来。",
      "file": "line_015.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 15912,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 116,
      "pause_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "role": "萨老头",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_male_1",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "pitch": -3,
      "text": "哪知道离家四十多年，家乡的亲戚朋友一个都不在了。刚好这家酒店的老蔡不想干了，三十两银子卖了给小老儿。",
      "file": "line_016.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 13068,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 96,
      "pause_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "idx": 17,
      "role": "萨老头",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_male_1",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 0.85,
      "pitch": -3,
      "text": "唉，总算回到故乡啦，听着人人说这家乡话，心里就说不出的受用，惭愧得紧，小老儿自己可都不会说啦。",
      "file": "line_017.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 13644,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 88,
      "pause_after_ms": 600
    },
    {
      "idx": 18,
      "role": "旁白",
      "voice_id": "audiobook_female_1",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "vol": 1.0,
      "speed": 0.95,
      "pitch": 0,
      "text": "那青衣少女低头托着一只木盘，在林平之等人面前放了杯筷，将三壶酒放在桌上，又低着头走了开去，始终不敢向客人瞧上一眼。",
      "file": "line_018.mp3",
      "audio_length_ms": 13536,
      "sample_rate": 32000,
      "channels": 1,
      "format": "mp3",
      "usage_chars": 109,
      "pause_after_ms": 600
    }
  ]
